---
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-name">
      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="display-1">
        <span class="name-line">Zulqarnain</span><br />
        <span class="name-line">Anjum.</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="amber-rule"></div>
      <div class="hero-social">
        <a href="https://github.com/sadatanjum" aria-label="GitHub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sadatanjum" aria-label="LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/>
            <rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect>
            <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:anjumsadat09082@gmail.com" aria-label="Email">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-portrait-wrapper">
      <img src="/images/portrait.png" alt="Portrait of Md. Zulqarnain Anjum" class="hero-portrait" loading="eager" width="600" height="800" />
    </div>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">— Introduction</span>
      <h2 class="hero-headline">Data analyst turning messy operations data into daily decisions. Based in Dhaka.</h2>
      <p class="hero-body">I build the reporting layer that operations teams actually run on — SQL extracts, automated spreadsheets, and dashboards that answer the question before someone has to ask it. Currently analysing last-mile logistics at CarryBee Express, and reading for an MSc in Data Science at Jahangirnagar University.</p>
      <span class="availability-pill">Open to analyst roles · Taking freelance projects</span>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/#work" class="btn-primary">See my work</a>
        <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" download="Zulqarnain-Anjum-Data-Analyst.pdf">Download résumé</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.hero { min-height: 100vh; min-height: 100dvh; min-height: 640px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-8); }
.hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%, rgba(255,175,41,0.12) 0%, transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 85%, rgba(66,70,87,0.3) 0%, transparent 50%); pointer-events: none; }
.hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-6); position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: var(--container); margin: 0 auto; min-height: 600px; }
.hero-name { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }
.display-1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-display); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text); margin: 0; }
.amber-rule { width: 64px; height: 4px; background-color: var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); margin-top: var(--space-2); }
.hero-social { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-2); }
.hero-social a { color: var(--text-muted); transition: color var(--transition-fast); }
.hero-social a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
.hero-portrait-wrapper { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; }
.hero-portrait { max-width: 100%; max-height: 90vh; height: auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)); }
.hero-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); text-align: left; }
.hero-headline { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-h1); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--text); margin: 0; }
.hero-body { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--step-p); color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.85; max-width: 480px; margin: 0; }
.availability-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3); background-color: rgba(255,175,41,0.1); color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--step-small); font-weight: 500; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); border: 1px solid rgba(255,175,41,0.2); width: fit-content; }
.hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); margin-top: var(--space-2); }
</style>
